  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a pressure cooker over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the berbere spice and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped pecan nuts and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the tomato paste, vegetable broth, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Close the pressure cooker and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Let the pressure release naturally, then open the lid and stir the atakilt wat.",
    "Serve the atakilt wat hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro or scallions."
